entries[471359] = { ["name"] = "\"Gold\" Fish", ["text"] = "5 yd range\nInstant\nWhile its name is a cute indicator of the thick golden residue infinitely oozing from their gills, it's an otherwise uncomfortable reminder of the Undermine's unregulated industrialization.\n\nThis fish is now an unrecognizable product of its environment.\n\nSpecial:\n\nBlair Bass\n\nIn an effort to preserve the pristine Undermine ecosystem, this... \"fish\" would be of great interest to Blair Bass.\n\nAreas you can find this fish:\n\n- Undermine\n\nFishing Pools:\n\n- Steamwheedle Runoff\nProfession:\nFishing" }
