entries[471365] = { ["name"] = "Undermine", ["text"] = "Instant\nRecommended Skill: 375\n\nChannels of Steamwheedle Runoff ooze from the various pipes. Its waters are only inhabited by the sturdiest Khaz Algar fish and whatever else can stomach the pungent liquid.\n\nPools found in this zone:\n- Glimmerpool\n- Infused Ichor Spill\n- Steamwheedle Runoff\nProfession:\nFishing (225)" }
